簡略化などしていただいても構いません！\n\nまた資料については、いくつか入っておりますが、基本的には立ち絵を参考にしていただけると幸いです。\n\n✧\n\n使用用途としては、SNSへの投稿やアイコン・ヘッダー等個人使用(ID記載)、個人利用の範囲での印刷・グッズ作成、自陣PLへの共有などが主となります。\n\n✧\n\n金額やその他不備等ございましたらお気軽に再送いただければと思います。\nぜひご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ozJXuQUKeM4z-WUH9In0vdGsUcL9xgzU", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1158780, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "えのまる💫", "screen_name": "number_TRPG", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1930094699949502464/Wq640aHi.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1264327466870386688/1735916951/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "novel"}], "banned": false, "nc": 0}, {"id": 1746171, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ｶｶﾄ", "screen_name": "spcsa35", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1934423053192314881/TvhDaQ3w.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1199045369608339456/1776951905/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 16}, {"id": 2718263, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "hiyoko", "screen_name": "PUMZ03", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2032229943808319488/WE9QOK8t.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1648170063797846017/1768191945/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_